{"doc_id": "7362dc8f3628b0f9b28dbca616cdabafa7f8725d2a3dd00b2eee04c49a7f81ad", "extractor_version": "0.3.0", "schema_version": "1.1.0", "field": "scope_summary", "status": "present", "value_ja": "本業務は、道（以下、「委託者」という。）が「北海道デジタル化取組方針（第４期）」で掲げる「デジタル活用人材（レベル２）」を育成するため、研修を実施し、その研修に係る知識と経験のある講師等の業務を委託する。\nなお、本年度は、生成AI及びAIエージェント等のデジタル技術の進展を踏まえ、業務改善（BPR）の視点によるデジタルマインドの習得に加え、受講者が今後の業務効率化の展望を持てるよう、カリキュラムの充実を図るものとする。", "normalized": null, "value_en": "This service commissions knowledgeable and experienced instructors to conduct training to develop 'Digital Utilization Personnel (Level 2)' under Hokkaido's 4th Digitalization Policy, with an enhanced curriculum incorporating generative AI, AI agents, and a BPR perspective so trainees can envision future operational efficiency improvements.", "citations": ["p1_s5", "p1_s6"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "web", "model": "gemini-web", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-web"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-11-23", "prompt_version": "sv4-l1"}], "agreement": true, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": null, "review_note": null, "final_state": "silver_consensus", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": null}}
